00:57:41.030 --> 00:57:49.460
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He just saw the film Cool Runnings last week, and he wondered, is that a documentary?
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托里·马拉蒂亚先生。他上周刚看了电影《冰上轻舞》，他想知道，那是纪录片吗？

00:57:49.460 --> 00:57:57.620
<v Adam Mansbach>Really, the first thing I did was send it to every Jamaican I knew. And be like, yo, so what do you think about this?
<v Adam Mansbach>真的，我做的第一件事就是把它发给我认识的每一个牙买加人。心想，哟，所以你们觉得这个怎么样？

00:57:57.620 --> 00:58:01.600
